        <summary>
          <para>In this mode, the WebView will allow a secure origin to load content from any other origin, even if that origin is insecure. This is the least secure mode of operation for the WebView, and where possible apps should not set this mode.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/webkit/WebSettings#MIXED_CONTENT_ALWAYS_ALLOW" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.webkit.WebSettings.MIXED_CONTENT_ALWAYS_ALLOW</code>.</a></format></para>
